cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "kicad-preflight: check a KiCad project or BOM before you order the board"
version: 0.7.1
date-released: 2026-11-19
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/kicad-preflight"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/kicad-preflight"
abstract: >-
  Reads a KiCad project (or a standalone BOM CSV from any EDA tool) before
  the board or parts are ordered and gives one plain-English report — PASS,
  CAUTION, or BLOCK — from deterministic checks: schematic-to-PCB agreement,
  BOM sanity, and offline part-risk flags.
keywords:
  - KiCad
  - PCB
  - BOM
  - preflight
  - electronics
